The Pyra Launcher ("Software") is an open-development, source-available desktop
game management platform created by fmdxp ("Copyright Holder").

This License establishes a formal framework that encourages community participation,
source code transparency, bug reporting, and collaborative feature development,
while safeguarding the integrity of official project distributions, backend services,
and end-user security.

By accessing, cloning, compiling, installing, or contributing to this Software,
you accept and agree to be bound by the terms of this License.

